      "id": "e0417eed-d27c-4267-b024-dd98c6d066dd",
      "name": "Tests",
      "description": {
        "content": "Endpoints related to retrieving details of tests of the Develocity instance. \nTo access these endpoints the user requires the `Access build data via the API` permission.\nThe Develocity installation also needs to have the Test Failure Analytics feature enabled.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
